    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Fallen&quot;</strong> is a game about a small sphere's journey to become a bright light that shines on the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GamePlay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You have to avoid many obstacles and go up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If you touch an obstacle while climbing, you lose your strength and fall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Avoid all obstacles in a total of 5 themes and reach the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control is simple. Move with <strong>direction keys + space bar</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two ways to move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you press the space bar briefly, it moves for a short distance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, If you press and hold the space bar, the distance traveled increases by the pressed time,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and you can pass through obstacles during this movement.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Fallen&quot;</strong> is a game about a small sphere's journey to become a bright light that shines on the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GamePlay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You have to avoid many obstacles and go up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- If you touch an obstacle while climbing, you lose your strength and fall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Avoid all obstacles in a total of 5 themes and reach the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control is simple. Move with <strong>direction keys + space bar</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two ways to move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you press the space bar briefly, it moves for a short distance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, If you press and hold the space bar, the distance traveled increases by the pressed time,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and you can pass through obstacles during this movement.</p>",
    "short_description": "Be the light that shines on the world by climbing to the top. The way up is never easy. Can you avoid all obstacles and climb to the top?",
